[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428861\">1016A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Act on the drive pulley bolt using a suitable\nspanner so that the valves are in the closed position.</p><p>With the engine cold, check, using a feeler\ngauge, that with the valves in a closed position the clearance is within\nthe recommended values.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Valve clearance (mm)</p></td><td><p>Exhaust</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.40 ÷ 0.50</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Inlet</p></td><td colspan=\"3\"><p>0.30 ÷ 0.40</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428861\">1016A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]